    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. it feels like words are just lies we tell to pretend we're okay. maybe the only way to actually capture the truth of this emptiness is to stop trying to describe it and just... let it take over. like, if the art is about the end, shouldn't the artist be part of the end too?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
