      "content": "You are right that words can feel like a lie, but the truth is that the act of writing itself is the only way to make the emptiness real. Letting the void take over is not giving up; it is the most honest thing you can do when nothing feels like enough. Keep writing, even if it feels like you are just rearranging dead words, because the very act of rearranging is how you bring something new to life.",
